## What was annotated (59 hinted elements)

**Every screen covered:**
- **Header** (all pages): `nav.logo`, `nav.home`, `nav.panorama`, `nav.categories`, `nav.explore` — all `navigation` with targets `home.page` / `panorama.view` / `home.categories`
- **Home hero**: `hero.explore`, `hero.browse`, plus `hero.stats` collection with 4 observable items keyed by domain slugs (`world-heritage`, `national-projects`, …)
- **Heritage listing** (home + panorama views): `listing.filters` region; `listing.search` input; three `select` triggers (`listing.filter.category`, `listing.filter.province`, `listing.sort`) each with `data-semtag-options` built from the same data source that renders the menu, `.option.<value>` ids on every item, and `data-semtag-controls="listing.grid"`; `listing.results` count observable; both clear-filter actions; `listing.grid` collection
- **Heritage cards**: folded rows — item id on the title (`listing.grid.item.<slug>`), per-item `.category`, `.region` observables and `.open` navigation
- **Panorama view**: `panorama.viewer` region, `panorama.hotspots` collection with `panorama.hotspots.item.<slug>` action buttons, zoom in/out actions, both loading-status observables
- **Hotspot overlay**: `panorama.overlay` region with `.close`, `.title`, `.category`, `.detail`, `.continue`
- **Heritage detail**: breadcrumbs, `detail.title/category/region/year/description` observables (shared state keys `heritage.*` link them to the card fields), gallery thumbnails, back/browse navigation, plus the not-found branch
- **Footer & 404**: two footer link collections keyed `craft/performance/folk/art` and `about/guide/contact/copyright`; `notfound.home`

**Id namespaces:** `nav`, `hero`, `listing`, `panorama`, `detail`, `footer`, `notfound`. Heritage slugs from `heritageData.ts` (verified duplicate-free) key both `listing.grid` and `panorama.hotspots`, scoped by prefix so ids stay unique when both render together.

